# AllThingsAndroid agent rules

- Read the matching official skill in `.agents/skills/android` before coding that area.
- DI is Koin (one module per feature). Network is Ktor. Do not add Hilt or Retrofit.
- Never commit to `master`. Conventional Commits. Never add `Co-authored-by` or AI attribution.
- After finishing a work slice, stop so the user can review the diff. Commit only when they ask.
- No `android.util.Log`. Inject the project logger.
- New screen = Screen + ViewModel + state + fake + unit test + Compose UI test.
- `demo` flavor must run without secrets.

```kotlin
// BAD
android.util.Log.d("Shop", "added")
// GOOD
logger.d("Cart item added")
```
